      "Home",
      "",
      "“There is water here. Do you want to drink water?” she asked.",
      "",
      "“Yes!” I drank the water.",
      "",
      "She saw me drinking water, and she smiled!",
      "“Did you know? I went to the hospital with you.",
      "At the hospital, the doctor said that if you can eat food and drink water, that means you’re better.",
      "Now, you’ve eaten food and drunk water. That’s great! I’m so happy!",
      "There is a lot of rice here, and a lot of water here. You should eat some more!”",
      "",
      "What is this place? Here, I can eat food and I can drink water. It’s really great here!",
      "",
      "“Do you want to sleep? You can sleep there.”",
      "",
      "What is this place? It’s neither cold nor hot here. I can sleep here. It’s really great here!",
      "",
      "“I’ll be your mom, okay? This is your home, okay?”",
      "",
      "Home? Is this the “home” that Fanfan was talking about?",
      "Yes! Fanfan said that home is a good place. You can eat food there, sleep there, and play there.",
      "",
      "Here there is food and there is water. I can sleep and I can play. Yes! This is home! I have a home!",
